OTHERS DO NOT,

00:18:38.984 --> 00:18:41.386
AND SOME HAVE AUTHORIZATION,
BUT ONLY

00:18:41.453 --> 00:18:43.655
UNDER SPECIFIC CIRCUMSTANCES.

00:18:43.722 --> 00:18:46.391
IN OUR BUDGET SUB FIVE HEARING
LAST MONTH,

00:18:46.458 --> 00:18:48.994
CALTRANS COMMENTED THEY REALLY

00:18:49.061 --> 00:18:51.563
