00:18:51.630 --> 00:18:53.765
IT ENSURES QUALITY OF THE
PRODUCT

00:18:53.832 --> 00:18:56.335
AS WELL AS QUALITY OF THE JOBS.

00:18:56.401 --> 00:18:58.737
THE AD HOC CONTRACTING
AUTHORITY,

00:18:58.804 --> 00:19:01.139
WHICH IS OFTEN DONE IN VERY
DIFFERENT

00:19:01.206 --> 00:19:02.741
